BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.680 0.180 0.240 rg 54.00 493.39 Td (Easy Answer \(In Simple Words\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.120 0.150 0.200 rg 54.00 481.89 Td (For Binary classification it is well-balanced \(53.5% Normal vs 46.5% Attack\), but for 5-Class) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.120 0.150 0.200 rg 54.00 471.39 Td (classification it is heavily imbalanced \(U2R is only 0.04% of rows\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.7 Tf 0.100 0.130 0.180 rg 48.00 460.89 Td (ï Exact Class Distribution in Training Set \(125,973 rows\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 0.220 0.260 0.320 rg 58.00 449.39 Td (Normal: 67,343 \(53.46%\)  |  DoS: 45,927 \(36.46%\)  |  Probe: 11,656 \(9.25%\)  |  R2L: 995) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 0.220 0.260 0.320 rg 58.00 438.59 Td (\(0.79%\)  |  U2R: 52 \(0.04%\). Notice how rare R2L and U2R attacks are!) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.7 Tf 0.100 0.130 0.180 rg 48.00 425.29 Td (ï How We Handled It ó 1. Balanced Class Weighting:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 0.220 0.260 0.320 rg 58.00 413.79 Td (In src/model_training.py, we set class_weight='balanced' inside RandomForestClassifier. This) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 0.220 0.260 0.320 rg 58.00 402.99 Td (penalizes mistakes on rare classes \(U2R/R2L\) up to 1,000x more heavily than majority classes.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.7 Tf 0.100 0.130 0.180 rg 48.00 389.69 Td (ï How We Handled It ó 2. Unsupervised Isolation Forest + Composite Features:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 0.220 0.260 0.320 rg 58.00 378.19 Td (We trained an Isolation Forest ONLY on Normal traffic so rare attacks are caught as) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 0.220 0.260 0.320 rg 58.00 367.39 Td (statistical outliers regardless of sample size, and created 'suspicious_activity' to amplify) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.4 Tf 0.220 0.260 0.320 rg 58.00 356.59 Td (R2L/U2R signals.) Tj ET
